{"availability":"available","full":"spiculedata/saiku","name":"saiku","description":"Open-source semantic layer: one cube for Excel (MDX/XMLA), dashboards, and AI agents (MCP). Mondrian + Apache Calcite.","category":"Business","language":"Java","stars":1329,"forks":658,"created":"2011-10-05T20:15:06Z","updated":"2026-10-12T17:21:31Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"development","homepage":"https://saiku.bi","topics":["analytics","apache-calcite","business-intelligence","mcp","mdx","mondrian","olap","semantic-layer","xmla"],"demo":"https://demo.saiku.bi/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T07:35:06.214Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T07:35:06.214Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T07:35:06.214Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:23:24.738Z","stars":1330,"forks":659},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:13:53.260Z","stars":1329,"forks":659},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:05:04.446Z","stars":1329,"forks":658},{"at":"2026-10-13T07:35:06.214Z","stars":1329,"forks":658}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Then open and log in with admin / admin. Demo mode ships a self-contained H2 + FoodMart cube — drag fields onto rows, columns, or filters and the SPA writes MDX for you.","For a real deployment, drop SAIKUDEMO=true and set an admin password: -e SAIKUADMINPASSWORD='a-strong-password' (or -e SAIKUADMINPASSWORDFILE=/run/secrets/saiku-admin-password). Saiku refuses to start on the default admin/admin once it's network-reachable, so one of those two is required — and the password must itself clear the policy (≥ 12 characters, not a well-known weak password), so SAIKUADMINPASSWORD=admin is refused too.","Demo fixtures follow demo mode (saiku#1953). A boot without SAIKUDEMO=true stages no demo content: no FoodMart/Bank/TPC-DS/Flights schemas, no H2 fixtures, no datasource descriptors — a fresh home comes up with an empty datasource list. Set SAIKUSEED=true to install the fixtures on a non-demo boot, or SAIKUDEMO=true SAIKUSEED=false for the demo login against your own cubes. Seeding is seed-if-absent, so an existing saiku-home is never rewritten or emptied."],"features":["Mondrian 4.8.1.x (Spicule fork) — with a Calcite-based SQL planner","Apache Arrow wire format for cellsets, so the browser and any","Jetty 12 EE10 + Jersey 3.1 + Spring 6 + Spring Security 6.5 in a","SvelteKit 5 + Vite for the SPA (separate repo, served from inside"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/spiculedata/saiku/blob/development/README.md","fingerprint":"f17c5eb58a05f2f7c8bdcd4a1fc0c51c3e52cd8a1cd71d2ea26ae0aac338812e","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T04:09:14.846Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T04:09:14.846Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Then open and log in with admin / admin. Demo mode ships a self-contained H2 + FoodMart cube — drag fields onto rows, columns, or filters and the SPA writes MDX for you.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/spiculedata/saiku/blob/development/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Then open and log in with admin / admin.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/spiculedata/saiku/blob/development/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Set SAIKUSEED=true to install the fixtures on a > non-demo boot, or SAIKUDEMO=true SAIKUSEED=false for the demo login against > your own cubes.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/spiculedata/saiku/blob/development/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"f17c5eb58a05f2f7c8bdcd4a1fc0c51c3e52cd8a1cd71d2ea26ae0aac338812e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/spiculedata/saiku/blob/development/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T04:09:14.847Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T18:42:42Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/spiculedata/saiku/blob/development/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:47:52.004Z","hash":"f17c5eb58a05f2f7c8bdcd4a1fc0c51c3e52cd8a1cd71d2ea26ae0aac338812e","originalBytes":24155,"storedBytes":24155,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["saiku","docs","issue","gi